Ah, ok. Yes, this is also possible like this:
require('mini.ai').setup({
  custom_textobjects = {
    -- Tweak textobject id to your liking
    e = { { '%b()', '%b[]', '%b{}', '%b<>', "%b''", '%b""', '%b``' }, '^.().*().$' },
  },
})
Note, that there are already built-in aliases for braces and quotes.

